{#- What a deployed environment differs in, keyed by its name. Everything else a deployed
    environment's files say derives from the name (the Sentry and OpenTelemetry environment).
    The stubs under the project template's .envs name their environment and include the
    source for their kind (docs/adr/0023). -#}
{#- The host the environment answers for: a prefix of the domain for dev and test, the apex for production -#}
{%- set hosts = {
    "dev": "dev." ~ cookiecutter.domain_name,
    "test": "test." ~ cookiecutter.domain_name,
    "production": cookiecutter.domain_name,
} -%}
{#- Whether the apex also answers as www: only production sits on the apex -#}
{%- set www = {"dev": false, "test": false, "production": true} -%}
